<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Deathcar</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Fightstar</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">One Day Son, This Will All Be Yours</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7wSf572xy3bhKgen9xFybQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">6 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Deathcar Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Drive!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're not going to be prepared for this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You've left a trail of red and crossed it on your front door</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And now I'm here so</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're first on my list of things to do today</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Follow me outside and I'll</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Feed those hungry eyes of yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So bring out the deathcar and we'll drive tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're only making this worse</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So bring out the deathcar and we'll sleep tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just say the words and this will all end right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let's close the door and start the fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really do hope you're comfortable</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I strap you down and chose my tool because</p><p ttm:agent="v1">First the arms and then the eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'll leave the hands, I know you touch her with them</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You make me fucking sick[Pre-Chorus 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Swallow your last breath of air</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Feel your lips grow cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So bring out the deathcar and we'll drive tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're only making this worse</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So bring out the deathcar and we'll sleep tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just say the words and this will all end right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You drove me to this, how will I ever stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm addicted to kill as much as I am to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So bring out the deathcar and we'll drive tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're only making this worse</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So here's the deathcar and we will feast tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just say the words and this will all end</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Post-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now you can see how it feels</p></div></body></tt>